---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Telechargements - RadioPack France" description="Telecharge les CSV CHIRP RadioPack France et le guide PDF du pack Normandie.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Fichiers generes, sources et documentes</span>
      <h1 class="title">Telechargements</h1>
      <p class="lead">Sprint 4 : le pack Normandie v0.3 contient 139 memoires organisees par blocs, ainsi qu'un guide PDF complet.</p>

      <div class="notice card">
        <div class="notice-icon">!</div>
        <div><strong>Emission bloquee par defaut</strong><p>Dans tous les CSV publics, <code>Duplex=off</code> bloque l'emission. Les canaux radioamateurs et les sorties de relais sont fournis pour la reception.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2 downloads">
        <article class="download-card normandie">
          <div class="topline"><span class="badge badge-green">Beta - v0.3.1</span><span>139 / 200 memoires</span></div>
          <h2>Normandie - pack v0.3</h2>
          <p>PMR446, VHF marine, APRS/ISS, aviation, canaux d'appel et relais analogiques verifies.</p>
          <ul><li>Blocs de memoires separes</li><li>15 relais ou transpondeurs analogiques</li><li>Reception seule</li></ul>
          <div class="button-row">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="/downloads/normandie/radiopack-france-normandie-v0.3.1.csv" download>CSV Normandie v0.3</a>
            <a class="button button-orange" href="/downloads/normandie/radiopack-france-normandie-v0.3.1-guide.pdf" download>Guide PDF</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="download-card repeaters">
          <div class="topline"><span class="badge">Normandie - v0.3.1</span><span>14 memoires</span></div>
          <h2>Relais analogiques RX</h2>
          <p>Sorties ou voies d'ecoute verifiees dans la Manche, la Mayenne, le Calvados et la Seine-Maritime.</p>
          <ul><li>ARA50, REF, SHTSF et F8KII</li><li>NFM et noms courts UV-K5</li><li>Emission bloquee</li></ul>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/downloads/normandie/radiopack-france-normandie-repeaters-rx.csv" download>CSV relais Normandie</a>
        </article>

        <article class="download-card calls">
          <div class="topline"><span class="badge badge-orange">National - v0.3.1</span><span>2 memoires</span></div>
          <h2>Canaux d'appel radioamateur</h2>
          <p>145,500 MHz en 2 m et 433,500 MHz en 70 cm, d'apres les plans de bande du REF.</p>
          <a class="button button-orange" href="/downloads/national/radiopack-france-amateur-calls-rx.csv" download>CSV canaux d'appel</a>
        </article>

        <article class="download-card marine">
          <div class="topline"><span class="badge">National - v0.2.0</span><span>90 memoires</span></div>
          <h2>France - VHF marine RX</h2>
          <p>Plan international conventionnel : simplex, voies navire/cote, DSC et AIS.</p>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/downloads/national/radiopack-france-marine-vhf-rx.csv" download>CSV marine</a>
        </article>

        <article class="download-card national">
          <div class="topline"><span class="badge badge-green">National - v0.1.0</span><span>16 memoires</span></div>
          <h2>France - PMR446 RX</h2>
          <p>Les 16 canaux analogiques PMR446 en NFM, emission bloquee.</p>
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/downloads/national/radiopack-france-pmr446-rx.csv" download>CSV PMR446</a>
        </article>

        <article class="download-card space">
          <div class="topline"><span class="badge badge-orange">National - v0.2.0</span><span>6 memoires</span></div>
          <h2>France - APRS & ISS RX</h2>
          <p>APRS terrestre et principales frequences descendantes publiees par ARISS.</p>
          <a class="button button-orange" href="/downloads/national/radiopack-france-amateur-listening-rx.csv" download>CSV APRS / ISS</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3 info-grid">
        <article class="card"><span class="badge">138</span><h3>Memoires organisees</h3><p>Les categories commencent sur des positions fixes et laissent des intervalles d'extension.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="badge badge-orange">PDF</span><h3>Guide complet</h3><p>Carte des memoires, liste des relais, tableau des frequences et sources.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="badge badge-green">Tests</span><h3>Controles automatiques</h3><p>Positions, doublons, noms courts, frequences cles et blocage TX sont verifies.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .title{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5rem);margin:18px 0}
  .notice{display:grid;grid-template-columns:48px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:start;margin:30px 0;padding:22px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(240,154,32,.12),rgba(255,255,255,.82))}
  .notice-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(240,154,32,.18);color:#ad6200;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:900}
  .notice p{margin-top:5px;color:var(--muted)}code{font-weight:800;color:#5f31cf}
  .downloads{margin-top:30px}.download-card{display:grid;gap:18px;padding:28px;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.78);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .download-card.national{background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.9),rgba(222,248,241,.7))}
  .download-card.normandie{background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.9),rgba(245,231,255,.72))}
  .download-card.marine{background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.9),rgba(222,242,255,.78))}
  .download-card.space{background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.9),rgba(255,239,216,.76))}
  .download-card.repeaters{background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.9),rgba(231,241,255,.78))}
  .download-card.calls{background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.9),rgba(255,237,222,.76))}
  .topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:800}
  .download-card h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.5rem)}.download-card p,.download-card li{color:var(--muted)}
  .download-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.15rem}.download-card .button{justify-self:start}
  .info-grid{margin-top:30px}.info-grid article{padding:24px}.info-grid h3{margin:16px 0 8px}.info-grid p{color:var(--muted)}
  @media(max-width:600px){.topline{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
</style>
